        "statement": "Without flood protection, IL-53 is threatened near downtown Lisle. Lake Drive and Forest View Road are threatened near Maple Avenue south of Lisle."
      },
      {
        "stage": 15,
        "statement": "Water reaches the top of levee at Lisle Community Park. Low-lying parking lots are threatened at Lisle High School."
      },
      {
        "stage": 13.5,
        "statement": "Without flood protection, residences are threatened along Lacey Avenue, River Drive, Dumoulin Avenue, and McKinley Avenue in Lisle. Short Street is threatened west of the river in Lisle. Parking lots are threatened at Lisle Community Park."
      },
      {
        "stage": 12.5,
        "statement": "Riverview Drive threatened in Lisle. Without flood protection, Lacey Avenue, River Drive, Dumoulin Avenue, and McKinley Avenue are threatened near the river in Lisle."
      },
